<div dir="auto"><br>
</div>
<div dir="auto">I went to Beverly Beach yesterday and South Beach today. I had a blast. These places really spoke to me. As soon as I got past Florence and the 101 met the coastline again, I was hooked.</div>
<div dir="auto"><br>
</div>
<div dir="auto">I want to head north. I'm looking for volunteer opportunities up there.</div>
<div dir="auto"><br>
</div>
<div dir="auto">I've reached out to South Beach, Nehalem Bay, and Cape Lookout. If you know any of these VSLs, I ask you to put in a good word for me. If you have thoughts on other places in that direction, friends who might be interested in what I bring to
 a place, I ask you help me.</div>
<div dir="auto"><br>
</div>
<div dir="auto">Thanks for your consideration.</div>
